kwin-effects-hdr-oled-saver (0.9.4-1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for Ubuntu 26.10 (Stonking).
  * Install the effect and its configuration module into the multiarch
    Qt 6 plugin directory used by KWin.
  * Pin the runtime KWin dependency to the exact kwin-dev version captured
    when the plugin is compiled, so the KWin effect plugin ABI cannot
    silently mismatch, and keep that build-tree snapshot when repackaging.
  * Build with Ninja and run the upstream CTest suite through dh_auto_test.

 -- deno <deno@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
